#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:5 8f2ea1a89d844737ac8347ec136d5dc8
msgid "Automatic Flaps"
msgstr "自动襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:7 3abd8b475610439495ddb7a794448d69
msgid ""
"Plane can control flaps in autonomous modes based on an airspeed schedule "
"and/or during autotakeoffs and landings. Simply put you can specify two "
"speeds and two flap settings. If your target speed (not your actual speed) "
"is above the specified speeds then your flaps are set to the default (trim) "
"position. If your target speed is lowered below the first flap speed, then "
"flaps are deployed to the first position, and if your target speed is "
"lowered below the second flap speed, then flaps are deployed to the second "
"position."
msgstr ""
"Plane "
"可在自主模式下根据空速计划和/或自动起飞和降落期间控制襟翼。简单来说，您可以指定两个速度和两个襟翼设置。如果目标速度（不是实际速度）高于指定速度，则襟翼设置为默认（微调）位置。如果目标速度低于第一个襟翼速度，则展开襟翼至第一个位置；如果低于第二个襟翼速度，则展开至第二个位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:16 9379f3937d284f17933baf952da32478
msgid ""
"The target speed can be commanded by changing the value of cruise_speed in "
"the parameter interface, by using the Do_Set_Speed command in a mission, or "
"by the throttle stick position in FBW-B."
msgstr ""
"目标速度可通过在参数界面更改 cruise_speed 值、在任务中使用 Do_Set_Speed 命令或在 FBW-B 模式下通过油门摇杆位置来指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:20 2845acfed94d46008a66d3c3fefc63d6
msgid ""
"Flaps can be configured on any channel (in older versions flaps could only "
"be configured on channel 5, 6, 7 or 8 with 8 not available for manual "
"control)."
msgstr "襟翼可以配置在任意通道上（在旧版本中，襟翼只能配置在通道5、6、7或8上，其中8不可用于手动控制）。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:23 0e5fdc1d6bc14aff817762b705dcae48
msgid "Software configuration"
msgstr "软件配置"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:25 f0eff1e7406445d5ba3cb41f0305b45c
msgid ""
"The first step in setting up flaps is to set the parameter for the channel "
"function for the channel you are using for flaps to a value of 3. For "
"example, if you have flaps on channel 5 then set "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` to 3."
msgstr ""
"设置襟翼的第一步是将您用于襟翼的通道的通道功能参数设置为3。例如，如果您的襟翼在通道5，则将 "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 设置为3。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:30 29dd8c713c854dd8bf7bb1edca345f32
msgid ""
"Next set the parameters for your two flap speeds and flap values. These "
"parameters are :ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`, :ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`, "
":ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"
msgstr ""
"接下来设置两个襟翼速度和襟翼值的参数。这些参数为 "
":ref:`FLAP_1_PERCNT<FLAP_1_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_PERCNT<FLAP_2_PERCNT>`、:ref:`FLAP_1_SPEED<FLAP_1_SPEED>`、:ref:`FLAP_2_SPEED<FLAP_2_SPEED>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:33 a20e8efcf9f64104aba22e1302046ce9
msgid ""
"Redo your radio calibration. Be sure to set the flap switch to the zero flap"
" position before finishing the radio calibration so that zero flaps is "
"stored as the trim (default) position."
msgstr "重新进行遥控校准。完成遥控校准前，请确保将襟翼开关拨到零襟翼位置，以便将零襟翼存储为微调（默认）位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:37 837321cfefa344dd9533132e2feda70e
msgid ""
"That is basically all the setup required for speed/manual controlled flaps. "
"If you find that your flaps are moving backwards from what you expect, "
"change the reversing parameter for your flap channel, for example "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>`. Set it to 1 to reverse the flaps, "
"set to 0 for normal operation."
msgstr ""
"以上基本上就是速度/手动控制襟翼所需的全部设置。如果您发现襟翼运动方向与预期相反，请更改襟翼通道的反向参数，例如 "
":ref:`SERVO5_REVERSED<SERVO5_REVERSED>`。将其设置为1可反转襟翼，设置为0则正常运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:43 998ca5ff224143b4ab2ac8b5c08f3794
msgid ""
"In addition, you can independently have flap positions for automatic "
"takeoffs and/:or landings using:"
msgstr "此外，您还可以单独设置自动起飞和/或降落时的襟翼位置，使用："

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:45 e4ed51eebe6f4276a85040ace67c5a33
msgid ":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>`"
msgstr ":ref:`LAND_FLAP_PERCNT<LAND_FLAP_PERCNT>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:46 be6ebd849056478c8381a23fba91c379
msgid ":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>`"
msgstr ":ref:`TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT<TKOFF_FLAP_PCNT>`"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:49 87c9df7ba4dc44b5905d1b283513a53c
msgid "Using flaps"
msgstr "使用襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:51 d0cbf0aa76474cfc8e81e241eb72fc02
msgid ""
"In Manual, Stabilize, or FBW-A modes your flaps will operate manually and "
"you can set them with your transmitter."
msgstr "在 Manual、Stabilize 或 FBW-A 模式下，您的襟翼将手动操作，可通过遥控器进行设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:54 44df22781c764a0a8bc43437a1e1816e
msgid ""
"In FBW-B the target airspeed is set by the position of the throttle stick. "
"If set up properly you should see flaps deploy as you lower the throttle "
"stick through the two flap airspeed ranges."
msgstr "在 FBW-B 模式下，目标空速由油门摇杆的位置决定。如果设置正确，当您将油门摇杆降低到两个襟翼空速范围内时，应能看到襟翼展开。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:58 32438dd105d74c63b5495aa0f5f11f24
msgid ""
"In RTL, Guided, and Auto modes flaps settings are determined by the schedule"
" in your parameters and the current value of cruise_speed. You can change "
"cruise_speed to a value in one of the flap ranges from the GCS and should "
"see the flaps deploy. Also, if you use the Do_Change_Speed command in "
"mission flaps will be deployed when the target speed is changed into one of "
"the flap speed ranges."
msgstr ""
"在 RTL、Guided 和 Auto 模式下，襟翼设置由参数中的时间表和 cruise_speed 的当前值决定。您可以通过 GCS 将 "
"cruise_speed 更改为某个襟翼速度范围内的值，并应能看到襟翼展开。此外，如果您在任务中使用 Do_Change_Speed "
"命令，当目标速度更改至某个襟翼速度范围时，襟翼将展开。"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:66 541f6108945c491a9a8ae06b0a25c766
msgid "Using Flaperons"
msgstr "使用副翼襟翼"

#: ../../source/docs/automatic-flaps.rst:68 58241df991a14384a96d2e67ae31e6a6
msgid ""
"You can also setup flaperons. Please see the separate :ref:`flaperon guide "
"<flaperons-on-plane>` for details."
msgstr "您也可以设置副翼襟翼。详情请参阅单独的 :ref:`副翼襟翼指南 <flaperons-on-plane>`。"
